# Metronome

> A free browser-based metronome for music practice.

Canonical URL: <%= Rails.application.config.x.site_url %>/

## Features

- Adjustable tempo from 40 to 240 BPM
- Configurable time signatures
- Volume controls
- Keyboard shortcuts for starting, stopping, and adjusting tempo
- Session and total playing-time tracking

The metronome runs directly in a modern web browser and requires JavaScript and Web Audio API support.
